extends ../../layouts/master.pug

block title
  title NBC Covenant Partner Scholarship | Ministry Tuition Assistance
  meta(name='description', content='Students from Covenant Partner districts may qualify for up to full tuition for Spanish programs or half tuition for English programs at NBC.')

block header
  include ../../components/header.pug

block content
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.bg-about-3
      .container
        .row
          .col-lg-12.text-center
            h1.text-display-2.color-gray-900 NBC Covenant Partner Scholarship Initiative
            p.text-body-lead-large.color-gray-600.mt-30
              | Scholarship support for students from districts in covenant partnership with NBC.

  section.section-box.mt-60.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-2
          .col-lg-8
            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              | Students from covenant partner districts are eligible for:
            ul.mt-20
              li
                | Up to half-tuition scholarships for NBC&rsquo;s English degree and certificate programs
              li
                | Up to full-tuition scholarships for NBC&rsquo;s Spanish degree and certificate programs

            .card-grid-style-2.card-square.mt-40.mb-30
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.text-comment
                | &quot;This is a life-changing blessing for me and the churches I will someday serve.&quot;
                br
                strong.text-bold.text-heading-5 [REPLACE WITH STUDENT TESTIMONY]
              .box-img-user
                .img-user.img-user-round
                  img(src='/assets/imgs/user-stories/photo-10105-100x100.jpg', alt='NBC student')
                h4.text-body-lead.color-gray-900.mb-5 Covenant Partner Scholarship recipient
                p.text-body-text-md NBC student

            h2#eligibility-benefits.text-heading-4.mt-50 Eligibility and Benefits
            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              | A student is eligible for the covenant partner scholarship if he or she is:
            ul.mt-20
              li
                | A member of a church that is in a district formally entered in a covenant partnership with NBC
              li
                | Enrolled in an NBC degree program or MPP/PPM certificate coursework

            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              | This Covenant Partner Scholarship opportunity:
            ul.mt-20
              li
                | Is for tuition only (excludes fees and books).
              li
                | Will not exceed 50% of the actual billed cost of tuition (100% for Spanish programs) when combined with other institutional aid (scholarships/grants).
              li
                | Will not exceed the actual billed cost of tuition for the term when combined with federal grants and/or outside grants/gift aid. Institutional scholarships will be reduced to resolve any excess aid. Federal student loans are not included when determining excess aid.
              li
                | Is awarded after the partnership is confirmed for any subsequent terms in the current academic year. It is not retroactive to prior terms or applicable to the current term of enrollment.
              li
                | Will be reviewed on an annual (academic year) basis for both student eligibility and available funding.

            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              | For more information about enrollment at NBC and scholarship opportunities, email 
              a(href='mailto:info@nbc.edu') info@nbc.edu
              |  or call 
              a(href='tel:+18008733873') (800) 873-3873
              | .

            .card-grid-style-2.card-square.mt-40.mb-30
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.text-comment
                | &quot;When our churches invest faithfully in the NBC Annual Offering, we are not only supporting the college—we are opening doors for men and women called to ministry. The Covenant Partner Scholarship strengthens our district and our future pastors.&quot;
                br
                strong.text-bold.text-heading-5 [REPLACE WITH CHURCH LEADER TESTIMONY]
              .box-img-user
                .img-user.img-user-round
                  img(src='/assets/imgs/user-stories/photo-10106-100x100.jpg', alt='Church leader')
                h4.text-body-lead.color-gray-900.mb-5 Pastor
                p.text-body-text-md Covenant Partner church

            h2#how-funded.text-heading-4.mt-50 How These Scholarships Are Funded
            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              | Covenant Partner districts make a good faith commitment for the NBC Annual Offering of 1/10 of 1% of the combined church income of all the churches on the district.
            p.text-body-text.mt-20
              | For example, a district whose combined church income is $10 million will set a district NBC annual offering goal of $10,000. This is the sum total of the local church annual offering giving, not an amount pledged in addition to local church giving.
            p.text-body-text.mt-20
              | Covenant Partner churches contribute 1/10 of 1% of their annual church income to the NBC annual offering. For example, a church that raises $100,000 will give at least $100. This giving counts toward the district composite goal.

            h2#for-covenant-partners.text-heading-4.mt-50 For Covenant Partners

            h3.text-heading-5.mt-30 Covenant Partner District Proposal
            p.text-body-text.mt-20
              strong NBC agrees to:
            ul.mt-20
              li
                | Provide scholarship equivalent up to half-tuition scholarships for its English degree and certificate programs and full-tuition scholarships for its Spanish degree and certificate programs to students who are members of a Covenant Partner district.
              li
                | Provide updates to the district office at least bi-annually regarding giving from each church.
              li
                | Provide a complete array of annual offering resources for download on its website.
              li
                | Provide printed promotional materials to any church that requests them.
              li
                | Invite each church who gives in the annual offering to increase commitment and become a Presidential Partner church ($1,000/year). This will move the church&rsquo;s district closer to its annual offering goal and provide some margin for churches who may not participate.

            p.text-body-text.mt-30
              strong The Covenant Partner District agrees to:
            ul.mt-20
              li
                | Set the district&rsquo;s NBC annual offering goal at 1/10 of 1% of total church income (of all churches).
              li
                | Promote the NBC annual offering to churches, stressing the benefit for the district&rsquo;s NBC students.
              li
                | Work with NBC to recruit Presidential Partner churches ($1,000/year giving that counts toward the district goal).
              li
                | Be prepared to supplement church giving as necessary from individual donors or district funds in order to meet the district&rsquo;s annual offering goal.
          .col-lg-2
          .col-lg-2
          .col-lg-4
            .text-center.mt-40
              a.btn.btn-black.shape-square.icon-arrow-right-white(href='/covenant/partners/', target='_blank') View Covenant Partner Districts